DESCRIPTION:Cap at 12–13km at 6:30–6:45/km (strictly aerobic\, conversa
 tional effort\, no negative-split attempt)\n\nReason: Given only one run i
 n the last 4 weeks at a high HR\, jumping straight to a 17.6km long run af
 ter Treviso 10K the previous weekend risks injury and excessive soreness\;
